 "text": "1. **D** – The colour of mehendi (henna) comes from lawsone.\n2. **B** – Charvaka is the Indian materialist school of philosophy.\n3. **A** – The unit of permittivity is C²/(N·m²).\n4. **B** – \"বাবা-মা\" is a দ্বন্দ্ব সমাস.\n5. **C** – \"ভাইয়ে ভাইয়ে\" is কর্তায় ৭মী.\n6. **D** – The standard translation of this proverb is \"Faults are thick where love is thin.\"\n7. **A** – Combining n drops gives a potential of n^(2/3) × V₀. So 125^(2/3) × 220 = 25 × 220 = 5500 V.\n8. **B** – Bangladesh joined Interpol in 1976.\n9. **D** – 1s²2s²2p⁶3s¹ is sodium, a larger alkali atom, so it has the lowest first ionization energy.\n10. **B** – Winkler first described apomixis, embryo formation without fertilization.\n11. **D** – C₃H₈O has three isomers: 1-propanol, 2-propanol and ethyl methyl ether.\n12. **D** – Reading A = [[2,−2],[−2,2]] and B = [[2,2],[3,3]] from the garbled matrices, AB = [[−2,−2],[2,2]].\n13. **B** – A fungal spore germinates through a germ tube (জার্মনালি).\n14. **B** – A car wheel has both translational and rotational kinetic energy.\n15. **D** – China and Japan received observer status at the 2005 Dhaka SAARC summit.\n\n{\"answers\": {\"f4cb75c5-c842-4fae-9bf2-b5bbe591a79c-101909\": \"D\", \"f4cdc34a-fd0d-4feb-b30f-75773528cc85-119302\": \"B\", \"f5e9b2c9-3b8c-406e-8c43-529be7107207-28239\": \"A\", \"f60d30b5-a09d-4818-babb-9d51da77e715-45188\": \"B\", \"f8ff775e-ea54-4fe6-9fb5-101ce4ebfd37-95042\": \"C\", \"f90b5334-6a0e-453d-9adf-93255a1d7a39-55435\": \"D\", \"f966bd89-b180-4a83-947b-c8e61b629b8b-80459\": \"A\", \"fb455a31-ef9a-4b5a-8bd3-db38c37dd830-71194\": \"B\", \"fd68c50b-b87c-48d5-9cc7-90908312e11a-66227\": \"D\", \"fd7d0772-5b22-4014-913b-c89c9f5c0efd-5297\": \"B\", \"fdcd723e-eb3d-4bab-b5fc-e97688315a9f-82407\": \"D\", \"fe12d8f5-7827-487f-aa46-b695e0159c22-138390\": \"D\", \"feb68ba3-1e77-4fc8-a7aa-fcdfee040a5b-9014\": \"B\", \"ffbd11bc-4476-4e5d-aa58-809fece7ca5b-14789\": \"B\", \"ffc62154-ab08-46dc-a272-00103fc503d5-45955\": \"D\"}}